WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,390
Uncle, don’t worry

2
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,690
It’s not about which convenience store is bigger than the other.

3
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,210
It is the purchase price and selling price

4
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,340
My classmate’s family makes food.

5
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,380
The purchase price given to me is lower than outside.

6
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:16,940
That's good

7
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,060
Now it's finally open

8
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,080
Three days of rest

9
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:28,340
Does he know how we live? What do you want from Welcome?

10
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:31,190
You are Boss Lin’s new employees.

11
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,640
Xiaolin has moved away

12
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,700
Now this store is run by my niece

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:36,980
Things are more complete than before

14
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:39,020
The price is also more affordable. Is there coffee?

15
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,560
Of course there is
